flowchart LR
  Rider[Rider on horse] -->|UI| Phone[Mobile App]
  Phone -->|BLE| BLEA[BLE Link A]
  Phone -->|BLE| BLEB[BLE Link B]

  subgraph StdA[Jump Standard A]
    BLEA --> ESPA[ESP32 Controller]
    ESPA --> DRVA[Motor Driver]
    DRVA --> MOTA[Linear Actuator / Winch Motor]
    ENCA[Encoder] --> ESPA
    LIMA[Limit Switches] --> ESPA
    PWRA[Battery or DC Supply] --> DRVA
    PWRA --> ESPA
  end

  subgraph StdB[Jump Standard B]
    BLEB --> ESPB[ESP32 Controller]
    ESPB --> DRVB[Motor Driver]
    DRVB --> MOTB[Linear Actuator / Winch Motor]
    ENCB[Encoder] --> ESPB
    LIMB[Limit Switches] --> ESPB
    PWRB[Battery or DC Supply] --> DRVB
    PWRB --> ESPB
  end
